<main id="main" class="inner-article">
<header class="ahd">
    <div class="ameta">
      <span class="atg" style="background:var(--acl);color:var(--acd)">Shipping Guide</span>
      <span class="adt" data-nl-deepen="20261028">Updated 28 Oct 2026 · NL Douane</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="atit">MyCNBox verzending naar Nederland<br><em>Douane, NL-postcode 1234 AB, DHL/PostNL</em></h1>
    <p class="aint">Hoe een pakket naar een Nederlands adres reist: estimator op NL, postcode-vorm <strong>1234 AB</strong>, last mile vaak DHL/PostNL, invoer volgens SKU + <strong>Douane</strong>. Wereldwijde spreadsheet/coupons → <a href="https://mycnbox.eu/">mycnbox.eu</a>.
  </header>
  
<section id="local" class="local-box" data-nl-fingerprint="douane-1234ab-postnl" data-nl-deepen="20261028">
<h2>NL-fingerprint vóór je verzendt</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Estimator-bestemming: Nederland</strong> — kies NL, niet EU en niet deze hostname.</li>
<li><strong>Adres</strong> — Nederlandse postcode vorm <code>1234 AB</code> (geen Duits Packstation-nummer).</li>
<li><strong>Last mile</strong> — vaak <strong>DHL</strong> / PostNL-handoff; desk verzint geen servicepunt.</li>
<li><strong>Invoer / Douane</strong> — SKU beslist prepaid vs ontvanger. Bron ochtend van verzenden:
<a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/douane/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Belastingdienst Douane</a>.</li>
</ol>
<p>Cross-links: <a href="/is-mycnbox-legit/">Is MyCNBox legitiem?</a> ·
<a href="/mycnbox-coupons/">NL coupons</a> · brand-index →
<a href="https://mycnbox.eu/">mycnbox.eu</a>.</p>
</section>


<section class="local-box" id="douane-1234ab" data-nl-deepen="20261028">
<h2>Douane, postcode 1234 AB, DHL/PostNL</h2>
<p>Verzending naar <strong>Nederland</strong> betekent: estimator op <strong>NL</strong>, afleveradres met
postcode-vorm <strong>1234 AB</strong>, last mile vaak via <strong>DHL</strong> (soms PostNL-handoff), en
invoer volgens de <strong>SKU</strong> + actuele
<a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/nl/douane/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Douane</a>-regels.
Deze URL is geen «Shipping Guide 2026»-generiek stuk en geen spreadsheet-held — brand-index blijft op
<a href="https://mycnbox.eu/">mycnbox.eu</a>.</p>
<p>Prepaid duty vs duties payable by recipient kies je bij het pakket, niet bij de aankoop.
Geen onderwaardering. iDEAL is een NL-betaalrail in de officiële app — bevestig daar, niet op dit desk.
Datumstempel verdieping: <strong>28 Oct 2026</strong>.</p>
</section>

<h2 class="ph" id="calculator">Free MyCNBox shipping calculator</h2>
  <div class="calc" id="calc">
    <div class="cah">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
      <div><p class="cat">MyCNBox Shipping Calculator</p><p class="cas">Estimates based on 2026 rate tables</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cab">
      <div class="caf">
        <div><p class="cal">Destination</p>
          <select class="cas2" id="cc" onchange="cu()">
            <option value="us">&#127482;&#127480; United States</option>
            <option value="uk">&#127468;&#127463; United Kingdom</option>
            <option value="au">&#127462;&#127482; Australia</option>
            <option value="ca">&#127464;&#127462; Canada</option>
            <option value="de">&#127465;&#127466; Germany</option>
            <option value="fr">&#127467;&#127479; France</option>
            <option value="jp">&#127471;&#127477; Japan</option>
            <option value="sg">&#127480;&#127468; Singapore</option>
            <option value="br">&#127463;&#127479; Brazil</option>
            <option value="other">&#127757; Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><p class="cal">Item category</p>
          <select class="cas2" id="ccat" onchange="cc2()">
            <option value="shoes">Shoes / Sneakers</option>
            <option value="clothing">Clothing (T-shirt)</option>
            <option value="jacket">Jacket / Coat</option>
            <option value="bag">Bag / Backpack</option>
            <option value="accessories">Accessories</option>
            <option value="custom">Custom weight &darr;</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cal" style="margin-bottom:7px">Quick presets</p>
      <div class="cpre" id="cpre">
        <button class="cpr" onclick="sw2(300)">300g &mdash; tee</button>
        <button class="cpr on" onclick="sw2(700)">700g &mdash; shoes</button>
        <button class="cpr" onclick="sw2(1200)">1.2kg &mdash; jacket</button>
        <button class="cpr" onclick="sw2(2000)">2kg &mdash; bag</button>
      </div>
      <p class="cal" style="margin-bottom:5px">Weight (grams)</p>
      <input type="number" class="cai" id="cw" value="700" min="100" max="30000" step="50" oninput="cu()">
      <button class="cbtn" onclick="cu(true)">Calculate shipping cost &rarr;</button>
      <div class="cres" id="cres">
        <p class="crt">Estimated shipping options</p>
        <div class="crw" id="crow"></div>
        <p class="cdis">* Estimates only &mdash; actual rates may vary &plusmn;10%. Domestic freight ($1&ndash;3) not included.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="ph">All MyCNBox shipping lines</h2>
  <div class="lg">
    <div class="lc rec"><span class="lbg lbf">Fastest</span><p class="ln">DHL Express</p><p class="lt">5&ndash;8 days to USA</p><div class="lstat"><div class="lsr"><span>700g &rarr; USA</span><span>~$38</span></div><div class="lsr"><span>Tracking</span><span>Full</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="lc"><span class="lbg lbm">Balanced</span><p class="ln">EMS</p><p class="lt">10&ndash;20 days to USA</p><div class="lstat"><div class="lsr"><span>700g &rarr; USA</span><span>~$24</span></div><div class="lsr"><span>Tracking</span><span>Full</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="lc"><span class="lbg lbv">Best value</span><p class="ln">Economy Line A</p><p class="lt">15&ndash;25 days to USA</p><div class="lstat"><div class="lsr"><span>700g &rarr; USA</span><span>~$16</span></div><div class="lsr"><span>Tracking</span><span>Partial</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="lc"><span class="lbg lbb">Slowest</span><p class="ln">Economy Line B</p><p class="lt">25&ndash;45 days to USA</p><div class="lstat"><div class="lsr"><span>700g &rarr; USA</span><span>~$11</span></div><div class="lsr"><span>Tracking</span><span>Limited</span></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="ph" id="nl-table-note">Levertijden — focus Nederland</h2>
<p>Onderstaande tabel is lab-context. Voor <strong>Nederland</strong> kies je NL in de officiële estimator; postcode <strong>1234 AB</strong>; Douane-regels op de verzenddag. Geen spreadsheet-held op deze URL — index op <a href="https://mycnbox.eu/">mycnbox.eu</a>.</p>
  <div class="tw"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Country</th><th>DHL Express</th><th>EMS</th><th>Economy A</th><th>Economy B</th><th>DHL cost (700g)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>&#127482;&#127480; USA</td><td class="tf">5&ndash;8 days</td><td class="tm">10&ndash;18 days</td><td class="tm">15&ndash;25 days</td><td class="ts">25&ndash;40 days</td><td class="mv">~$38</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&#127468;&#127463; UK</td><td class="tf">4&ndash;7 days</td><td class="tm">10&ndash;16 days</td><td class="tm">14&ndash;22 days</td><td class="ts">22&ndash;38 days</td><td class="mv">~$34</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&#127462;&#127482; Australia</td><td class="tf">6&ndash;10 days</td><td class="tm">12&ndash;20 days</td><td class="tm">18&ndash;30 days</td><td class="ts">30&ndash;45 days</td><td class="mv">~$40</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&#127464;&#127462; Canada</td><td class="tf">5&ndash;9 days</td><td class="tm">12&ndash;20 days</td><td class="tm">18&ndash;28 days</td><td class="ts">28&ndash;42 days</td><td class="mv">~$39</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&#127465;&#127466; Germany</td><td class="tf">4&ndash;7 days</td><td class="tm">10&ndash;16 days</td><td class="tm">14&ndash;22 days</td><td class="ts">22&ndash;36 days</td><td class="mv">~$33</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&#127471;&#127477; Japan</td><td class="tf">3&ndash;5 days</td><td class="tm">7&ndash;12 days</td><td class="tm">10&ndash;18 days</td><td class="ts">18&ndash;30 days</td><td class="mv">~$28</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <div class="cb tip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg><div><strong>Consolidate to save money</strong><p>Store multiple items in the MyCNBox warehouse (free for 90 days) and ship them together. One DHL parcel with 3 items is far cheaper than three separate shipments.</p></div></div>
  <h2 class="ph">FAQ</h2>
  <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage"><div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How long does MyCNBox take to ship?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Domestic freight (seller &rarr; warehouse) takes 3&ndash;7 days. International: DHL 5&ndash;10 days, EMS 10&ndash;20 days, economy lines 20&ndash;45 days depending on destination.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How much does MyCNBox shipping cost?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">A 700g parcel to the USA costs approximately $11&ndash;16 via economy, $24 via EMS or $38 via DHL. Use the free calculator above for an instant estimate.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Does MyCNBox ship to the USA?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Yes. MyCNBox ships to the USA via DHL (5&ndash;8 days), EMS (10&ndash;18 days) and multiple economy lines (15&ndash;40 days).</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">What is domestic freight on MyCNBox?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Domestic freight is the fee to ship your item from the Chinese seller to MyCNBox&rsquo;s warehouse. Typically $0.70&ndash;3.50 USD, paid at checkout separately from international shipping.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How can I reduce MyCNBox shipping costs?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Consolidate multiple items into one shipment, use economy lines for non-urgent orders, request rehearsal packaging to reduce volumetric weight, and watch for seasonal shipping promotions.</div>
  </div>
</div></div>
</main>
